WEBVTT

00:00:00.856 --> 00:00:01.944
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Decisions</b>

00:00:02.999 --> 00:00:04.447
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I <b>won’t stay</b> for dinner.

00:00:04.929 --> 00:00:06.660
I think I<b>’ll go</b> home early.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:09.390
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Offers</b>

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.108
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I<b>’ll help</b> you with your homework.

00:00:14.096 --> 00:00:15.440
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>Shall</b> I <b>open</b> the window?

00:00:17.428 --> 00:00:18.477
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Promises</b>

00:00:19.407 --> 00:00:20.660
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I<b>’ll</b> always <b>love</b> you.

00:00:22.575 --> 00:00:23.970
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I <b>won’t tell</b> anybody.